rfc8452.txt
    Extracted by a script from the test vectors of RFC 8452 appendix C (C.1 AEAD_AES_128_GCM_SIV,
    C.2 AEAD_AES_256_GCM_SIV, C.3 counter wrap tests) of https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8452.txt,
    downloaded on 2026-10-24; the script checks every byte count the RFC prints.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions (code components under the Revised BSD License); the vectors are data.
    Format: Key = Value records under the heading of their section; hexadecimal values, named after the RFC labels
    (Plaintext, AAD, Key, Nonce, AuthenticationKey, EncryptionKey, POLYVALInput, POLYVALResult, XORNonce, Masked,
    Tag, InitialCounter, Result).
    Used: every record, including the intermediate values.
